        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding: &lt;/b&gt;Report CJ-603 Involves a bridge asset (BR-301), which should route to the structured department according to the policy (W06-S03). However, the delivery log (W06-S04) shows that it was incorrectly received by the Electrical department instead.&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question:&lt;/b&gt; What specific routing rule or configuration error caused this bridge asset report to misroute ?&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
